{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有網民今（29日）下午在社交平台發布短片，朗豪坊扶手處有老鼠爬來爬去，形容是「朗豪坊五星級大鼠」。影片所見，老鼠出沒引來市民圍觀，有人被嚇怕急速離開，亦有人拿出手機拍攝。有人留言直指香港鼠患問題嚴重，「香港鼠患勁到度度都有老鼠」。《香港01》正向商場查詢。</p><figure><img alt=\"（Threads@yiiq.o9）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159226379422666752362580.png/_hyusBWE6WnJ1yDsvZXSIF4bF82HC5NYf1HzIX9R8yE\"/><figcaption>（Threads@yiiq.o9）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朗豪坊扶手處有老鼠出沒。（Threads@yiiq.o9）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159226088098893824639572.png/JwKB4aKHF5SeEGiWg3p91_0MFbguv78xxlhwFMZYcBQ\"/><figcaption>朗豪坊扶手處有老鼠出沒。（Threads@yiiq.o9）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朗豪坊扶手處有老鼠出沒，引來路人圍觀。（Threads@tommychief_oil）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159225787077890048726340.png/84wlvDgYGv2AuQPk8cb57zRu0Igh9tgXckNsiXJDbIk\"/><figcaption>朗豪坊扶手處有老鼠出沒，引來路人圍觀。（Threads@tommychief_oil）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T12:19:37.422702+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":3,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none"}}